  "description": "Due to an accident, Yeo-Ul lost several months worth of memories. Upon waking up, he began a relationship with Seung-Ho who claimed to be his lover. However, for some reason, Yeo-Ul seemed to care a lot for Su-Hyeon. Similarly, Su-Hyeon is always paying attention to Seung-Ho and Yeo-Ul’s relationship. Between Su-Hyeon and Seung-Ho, Yeo-Ul is becoming increasingly confused. \n\n(Source: Wutopia Comics)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
